 Paris, winter                        | Europe/Paris   | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+00        | 1403-01-01 01:00:00        | 1403-01-01 01:00:00        | t  | t
 Paris, summer                        | Europe/Paris   | 1403-05-15 12:00:00+00        | 1403-05-15 14:00:00        | 1403-05-15 14:00:00        | t  | t
 Paris, last before the spring change | Europe/Paris   | 1403-01-12 00:59:59.999999+00 | 1403-01-12 01:59:59.999999 | 1403-01-12 01:59:59.999999 | t  | t
 Paris, the spring change             | Europe/Paris   | 1403-01-12 01:00:00+00        | 1403-01-12 03:00:00        | 1403-01-12 03:00:00        | t  | t
 Paris, last before the autumn change | Europe/Paris   | 1403-08-06 00:59:59.999999+00 | 1403-08-06 02:59:59.999999 | 1403-08-06 02:59:59.999999 | t  | t
 Paris, the autumn change             | Europe/Paris   | 1403-08-06 01:00:00+00        | 1403-08-06 02:00:00        | 1403-08-06 02:00:00        | t  | t
 instant given in Tehran time         | Asia/Tehran    | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+03:30     | 1403-01-01 00:00:00        | 1403-01-01 00:00:00        | t  | t
 UTC                                  | UTC            | 1403-01-01 12:34:56.789012+00 | 1403-01-01 12:34:56.789012 | 1403-01-01 12:34:56.789012 | t  | t
