 first valid instant, 20 hours west | ERR 22008                  | ERR 22008
 jtimestamp, 1 us before that       | ERR 22008                  | ERR 22008
 jtimestamp, first, 20 hours east   | -0061-01-01 16:00:00+00    | -0061-01-01 16:00:00+00
