 disjoint                       | 1403-01-01           | 1403-01-05                 | 1403-01-10                 | 1403-01-15          | false | false | f
 touching                       | 1403-01-01           | 1403-01-05                 | 1403-01-05                 | 1403-01-10          | false | false | f
 touching, the other way        | 1403-01-05           | 1403-01-10                 | 1403-01-01                 | 1403-01-05          | false | false | f
 one contains the other         | 1403-01-01           | 1403-01-30                 | 1403-01-10                 | 1403-01-12          | true  | true  | t
 swapped ends of the first      | 1403-01-10           | 1403-01-01                 | 1403-01-05                 | 1403-01-15          | true  | true  | t
 swapped ends of both           | 1403-01-10           | 1403-01-01                 | 1403-01-15                 | 1403-01-05          | true  | true  | t
 a point inside                 | 1403-01-05           | 1403-01-05                 | 1403-01-01                 | 1403-01-10          | true  | true  | t
 a point at the start           | 1403-01-01           | 1403-01-01                 | 1403-01-01                 | 1403-01-10          | true  | true  | t
 a point at the end             | 1403-01-10           | 1403-01-10                 | 1403-01-01                 | 1403-01-10          | false | false | f
